				{
					"id": 105011211,
					"content": "她為什麼只點了一份素麵啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011212
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105011212,
					"content": "是因為…她其實很缺錢嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011213,
					"content": "我都聽到了！說了是我請客，怎麼可能是因為摩拉這麼俗氣的理由！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011214,
					"content": "占星術士要專注於研究星空，若是被世間凡庸之物擾了心神，就會影響判斷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011215,
					"content": "尤其是用摩拉去過度滿足生理欲望，是低俗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011216,
					"content": "咕咕咕——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011217,
					"content": "…又危險的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011218,
					"content": "所以不吃我們點的菜，這也是占星術士的尊嚴嗎？真的好難懂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011219,
					"content": "但只有我們大吃大喝了一頓，會不會不太好？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011220,
					"content": "我來露一手吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105011221,
					"content": "哦，對啊，還可以這樣！妳等我們一下！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
